# Title: Potential Discovery Activity Using Find - MacOS
# ID: 85de3a19-b675-4a51-bfc6-b11a5186c971
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-12-28
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1083
# Description: Detects usage of "find" binary in a suspicious manner to perform discovery
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(process_name:*/find AND (cmdline:*-perm -4000* OR cmdline:*-perm -2000* OR cmdline:*-perm 0777* OR cmdline:*-perm -222* OR cmdline:*-perm -o w* OR cmdline:*-perm -o x* OR cmdline:*-perm -u=s* OR cmdline:*-perm -g=s*))
